{1}{Hello, youngling. Would you like to play a game?}{Hello, youngling. Would you like to play a game?}{}{}{}{}
{2}{Sure.}{}{5}{}{22}{}
{3}{What kind of a game, halfling?}{}{5}{}{7}{}
{4}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{7}{Oh, an old game, to be sure.  And a fun one, if ye be made of the right stuff.  You think you're game, do ye?}{Oh, an old game, to be sure.  And a fun one, if ye be made of the right stuff.  You think you're game, do ye?}{}{}{}{}
{8}{You're on.}{}{5}{}{22}{}
{9}{What are the rules?}{}{5}{}{11}{}
{11}{The rules?  Rules?  Well, if ye must know...I'll be asking you a question, and if ye be a'knowin' the answer, then the game continues.  If not, the game is over.  Agreed?}{The rules?  Rules?  Well, if ye must know...I'll be asking you a question, and if ye be a'knowin' the answer, then the game continues.  If not, the game is over.  Agreed?}{}{}{}{}
{12}{What do you mean, 'the game continues'?}{}{5}{}{16}{}
{13}{Sounds good.  Let's begin.}{}{5}{}{22}{}
{14}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{16}{Hmmm.  Not one to take chances, eh?  Well, let's just say that if you be a smart laddie, you get to keep testin' those brains...I'll say no more, out of respect to the old ways....}{Hmmm.  Not one to take chances, eh?  Well, let's just say that if you be a smart lass, you get to keep testin' those brains...I'll say no more, out of respect to the old ways....}{}{}{}{}
{17}{Fine.  I'm in.}{}{5}{}{22}{}
{18}{Forget it.  I don't meddle in the ways of halflings.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{22}{Ha!  Good, then, we'll begin straight off.   One question I'll ask, and one answer there be.  The wise man will spot what the dullard won't see. }{Ha!  Good, then, we'll begin straight off.   One question I'll ask, and one answer there be.  The wise man will spot what the dullard won't see. }{}{}{}{qu 1009 1}
{23}{Ask away.}{}{5}{}{26}{}
{24}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{26}{A painted face, hands with no bones.  My oldest brother was made of stones.  What am I?}{A painted face, hands with no bones.  My oldest brother was made of stones.  What am I?}{}{}{}{}
{27}{A mural.}{}{5}{}{}{qu 1009 6, fl 33}
{28}{A clock.}{}{5}{}{35}{qu 1009 2}
{29}{A scarecrow.}{}{5}{}{}{qu 1009 6, fl 33}
{30}{A fishing lure.}{}{5}{}{}{qu 1009 6, fl 33}
{31}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{33}{Wrong, my friend. Yet, no matter!  No harm done!  Go on your way, and you'll be none the poorer!  Good day!}{Wrong, my friend. Yet, no matter!  No harm done!  Go on your way, and you'll be none the poorer!  Good day!}{}{}{}{}
{35}{Correct!  Every clock has boneless hands, and we all know that sundials were first made of stone.  Ye seem to be a resourceful one...would ye like to continue?}{Correct!  Every clock has boneless hands, and we all know that sundials were first made of stone.  Ye seem to be a resourceful one...would ye like to continue?}{}{}{}{}
{36}{Of course.}{}{5}{}{39}{}
{37}{I'm a little leery of this affair.  Good bye.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{39}{Good sport!  Well, then.  If ye follow to the west, just beyond the camp of thieves, ye will find an ancient stand of trees that some call the Withered Grove.  There another of our kind awaits.  Good luck to you...}{Good sport!  Well, then.  If ye follow to the west, just beyond the camp of thieves, ye will find an ancient stand of trees that some call the Withered Grove.  There another of our kind awaits.  Good luck to you...}{}{}{}{}
{40}{Thank you.  I'll be on my way.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{42}{I've nothing left to say...go west, to the Withered Grove.}{I've nothing left to say...go west, to the Withered Grove.}{}{}{}{}
{43}{For someone as bright as yourself, you're acting a mite dull.  Go throught the Withered Grove, to the stony ground.}{For someone as bright as yourself, you're acting a mite dull.  Go throught the Withered Grove, to the stony ground.}{}{}{}{}
{44}{Nicely done.  We'll always remember you.}{Nicely done.  We'll always remember you.}{}{}{}{}
{45}{Sorry, youngling.  Your game has already been played...}{Sorry, youngling.  Your game has already been played...}{}{}{}{}
{46}{Did you think you could get away with yer crimes?  Die!}{Did you think you could get away with yer crimes?  Die!}{}{}{}{}

